   "key": "func CloudAccountGuard.lookUpBookkeeping()",
   "hash": "46bf40396ee8835b",
   "does": "Takes up to five ids from the manager's uploaded set; with none returns absent without any request. Fetches those records by id from the session zone of the signed-in account's private database, reading only isDeleted and writing nothing: any record returned (a tombstone included) gives found; records missing (unknownItem, zone gone) are skipped; any other per-record error gives unknown(message) unless a record is found. A whole-request zone/record-missing error gives absent; any other error is logged and gives unknown(cloudKitErrorMessage).",
